            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner, arizona argues that the Court should apply prior decisions in Chimel and Robinson to vehicle arrests to create a clear, workable rule for officers."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner",
          "citations": [
            {
